/**
 * Representative, privacy-safe global bank-alert corpus.
 *
 * These are deliberately close-to-production grammar specimens, not claims
 * that a bank sends these exact sentences. Each row is either reconstructed
 * from a documented alert family (`standard-derived`) or an independently
 * authored near-real template (`synthetic`). Values, merchants, references,
 * account fragments and dates are fictional.
 *
 * This corpus is useful for parser development and hard-negative regression.
 * It MUST NOT count toward consented-real rollout metrics.
 */

